      "caption": "Are you ready? 🌙✨ Ghufran Fiesta is coming your way very soon!\n\nJoin us on 10 & 11 October 2026 as we celebrate Masjid Darul Ghufran's 35th Anniversary!\n\n🗓️ 10 October: 10.00am – 10.30pm\n🗓️ 11 October: 10.00am – 6.30pm\n\nLook forward to two exciting days of delicious food, apparel and books, Islamic and family-friendly activities, inspiring talks, and so much more.\n\nBring your family and friends, reconnect with the community, and join us as we celebrate this special milestone together.\n\nFollow this space for more exciting updates, we'll be revealing what's in store very soon! 👀"
